flowchart LR
    V[Two synchronized camera views] --> D[DVIDEOW manual reference]
    V --> S[Sports2D 2D pose]
    V --> M[MediaPipe Pose 2D landmarks]
    V --> L[DeepLabCut 2D predictions]
    S --> C[Homologate hip, knee, ankle and foot]
    M --> C
    L --> C
    C --> Q[Automated 2D curation]
    D --> H[Pair camera observations]
    Q --> H
    H --> R[DLT reconstruction from supplied calibration]
    R --> T[Common 3D temporal filtering]
    T --> K[Positions, speeds and sagittal joint angles]
    K --> N[Normalize pre-impact to impact]
    N --> E[Compare methods and bilateral metrics]
    E --> O[CSV and JSON exports]
